---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Uses - Amirdaraee">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <img
        src="/amirdaraee-setup.jpg"
        class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg mx-auto"
        style="max-width: 60%;"
        alt="amirdaraee-setup"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Uses</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Uses is a website developer by Wes Bos. In order to answer
          questions about the software or hardware that a developer uses daily
          each developer get to have a uses page on their website so they can
          easily show their tools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">Check Uses Github repo to find out more</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Editor + Terminal</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Visual Studio Code:</strong> as for my personal
            projects and websites, I use VS Code which is in my mind one of the
            best editors out there.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Visual Studio Code Theme:</strong> after googling alot
            and asking around I choosed Dracula as for my main theme in VS Code.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Visual Studio 2019:</strong> currently at my work I'm
            using Visual Studio 2019 as my IDE alongside Resharper by JetBrains.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Desktop Apps</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Figma:</strong> as for my design tool, I use Figma for
            all of my projects.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Desk Setup</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Samsung C24F390 Monitor 24 Inch:</strong> Is my main
            monitor.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">PC Setup:</strong> Motherboard: Asus H87M-E,
            CPU: Intel Corei5-4440, GPU: Geforce GT-730, Memory: 8GB
            DDR3.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">My Laptop:</strong> Is a Surface Book Series 1 with
            Corei5, 8GB Memory, 120GB SSD.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
